  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds the two missing generic (typed-T) Update overloads and a way to clear\n      specific cells on the typed path:\n\n      UpdateRecordGeneric<T> — typed PATCH for a single record\n      UpdateMultipleRecordsGeneric<T> — typed PATCH for a batch\n      An optional string[] fieldsToClear parameter on both\n\n      Previously the generic overloads existed for Create (POST) and\n      Replace (PUT) only — Update (PATCH) had no generic variant, so updating a record\n      from a typed object wasn't possible without falling back to the dictionary-based\n      Fields/IdFields API.",
